  whostalking: ???
  dialogText:
  - "\"Sure, here you go.\" \n\nShe hands you two crumpled notes. You can't help
    but notice the flaking  purple nail polish on her thin fingers."
  - "As you turn to start the order, she calls out: \u201CHey\u2014do you have a
    phone charger back there? Mine died. I just need, like, thirty seconds of life
    to send \u2018I\u2019m not dead\u2019 to someone.\u201D\r\n"
  - "She holds up a small, dead phone. \u201CI\u2019ll step around to plug it in
    if that\u2019s okay. Promise not to touch anything.\u201D"
  character_img: {fileID: -9161298043115877563, guid: 6f5b357a0225308419df29447a66e28f, type: 3}
  background_img: {fileID: 0}
  emotionColor: {fileID: 0}
