  whostalking: ???
  dialogText:
  - A girl enters - shorts, grubby jacket, boots, eyeliner a little smudged, hair
    done like she either left a party or ditched one halfway.
  - She looks awake in the way only those few reckless, confident people do.
  - She surveys the empty joint, then walks to the counter with her hands shoved
    into her pockets.
  - "\u201CHey. Sorry to break your zen, but are you still open? Or is this \u2018employees
    only existential crisis hour\u2019?\u201D"
  character_img: {fileID: 5191031541360726387, guid: b7dc5f4f6e92d5e46a2844660c6f7a55, type: 3}
  background_img: {fileID: 0}
  emotionColor: {fileID: 0}
