  input: {fileID: 0}
  defaultNext: {fileID: 0}
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  canTeleport: 0
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - "<\"Yes --- !\"> \n\n... you think to yourself."
  - Finally your prayers have been answered. A cute girl is coming to your dead end
    job to make contact with you.
  - Play it cool...
  - '"Sorry, ma''am. No civilians behind the counter. It''s a crime scene. We have
    a dead body here behind the counter."'
  - 'After a moment of sheer incomprehension the tinest smirk creeps into the corner
    of her mouth.


    She raises an eyebrow.'
  - You rummage for a charger and hand it to her. "There is a plug right there. But
    if my boss comes and spots you behind the counter, you're robbing me, understood?"
  character_img: {fileID: -5365129548077109440, guid: a60307d3026a28a4e85fc9b480851209, type: 3}
  background_img: {fileID: 0}
  emotionColor: {fileID: 0}
